### ClassPropertyNode for Unified Property Information

Source: https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src/blob/2.2.x/_autodocs/06-virtual-nodes.md

Represents a single class property, unifying information from traditional and constructor-promoted properties.

```php
final class ClassPropertyNode implements VirtualNode {
    public function getProperty(): PropertyReflection
    public function getDocComment(): ?string
}
```

--------------------------------

### ClassPropertiesNode for Aggregating Class Properties

Source: https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src/blob/2.2.x/_autodocs/06-virtual-nodes.md

Aggregates all properties in a class, including inherited ones. Use for class-wide property constraints.

```php
final class ClassPropertiesNode implements VirtualNode {
    public function __construct(
        public ClassStatementsGatherer $statementsGatherer,
    ) {}

    public function getClassReflection(): ClassReflection
}
```

--------------------------------

### Virtual Node Rule for Class Properties

Source: https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src/blob/2.2.x/_autodocs/09-api-quick-reference.md

Implement a rule to process ClassPropertiesNode. Use getNodeType to specify the node type and processNode to iterate through class properties.

```php
use PHPStan\Node\ClassPropertiesNode;

final class ClassPropertiesRule implements Rule {
    public function getNodeType(): string {
        return ClassPropertiesNode::class;
    }

    public function processNode(Node $node, Scope $scope): array {
        $class = $scope->getClassReflection();

        foreach ($class->getProperties() as $prop) {
            // Check all properties
        }

        return [];
    }
}
```

--------------------------------

### AllPropertiesInitializedRule for Class Structure Checking

Source: https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src/blob/2.2.x/_autodocs/06-virtual-nodes.md

A PHPStan rule that checks if all properties of a class are initialized, particularly focusing on private properties without default values. It processes ClassPropertiesNode to gather class information.

```php
use PHPStan\Rules\Rule;
use PHPStan\Node\ClassPropertiesNode;
use PhpParser\Node;

final class AllPropertiesInitializedRule implements Rule {
    public function getNodeType(): string {
        return ClassPropertiesNode::class;
    }

    public function processNode(Node $node, Scope $scope): array {
        $class = $scope->getClassReflection();
        $errors = [];

        // Check that all properties are initialized in constructor
        foreach ($class->getProperties() as $prop) {
            if ($prop->isPrivate() && !$prop->hasDefaultValue()) {
                $errors[] = RuleErrorBuilder::message(
                    "Property {$prop->getName()} must be initialized"
                )->build();
            }
        }

        return $errors;
    }
}
```

### Minor backward compatibility breaks

Source: https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src/blob/2.2.x/UPGRADING.md

The return type of `ClassPropertyNode::getNativeType()` has changed from an AST node to `Type|null`. The `PHPStan\Node\ClassMethod` class, accessible from `ClassMethodsNode`, is no longer an AST node itself; retrieve the original AST node by calling `PHPStan\Node\ClassMethod::getNode()`.

